      "solution": "l = int(input())\nh = int(input())\nw = int(input())\n\nd1 = (l**2+h**2)**0.5\nd2 = (l**2+w**2)**0.5\nd3 = (w**2+h**2)**0.5\n\nif l!=0 and h!=0 and w!=0:\n    if d1 == round(d1) and d2 == round(d2) and d3 == round(d3):\n        print(\"Euler brick\")\n    else:\n        print(\"Regular brick\")\nelse:\n    print(\"Not a brick\")",
